// Run that waits for host (network on io_uring, §8.3): the machine process does not sleep in its ring - it
// is waiting for the server ring, and the editor responds while the program waits.
// — Shift+F5.
// grant: net
// run: live
// program: editor_wait_net.vish
open_view module
run
// expect: output text="слушаю\n" ok=true more=false state="running"
wait 3
// The program waits for connections - the editor responds
pointer 1 @print:1 0 0
// expect: cursor view=1
key 1 End
// expect: курсор:   print("слушаю");‸
stop
// expect: output text="" ok=true more=true state="stopped"
